    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf\u00a0<strong>Meet Arcana</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fusion of CCG and roguelike deckbuilder in a pixel-art SF fantasy world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Earth becomes uninhabitable due to global warming, humanity crash-lands on Arcana \u2014 a planet ruled by dragonkind.\u00a0In a world of racial hierarchy and oppression, humans rise again.\u00a0Battle and persuade other species, build alliances, and challenge the dragons in a fight for equality and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and customize over <strong>130 unique cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching paths and manage resources in <strong>roguelike deckbuilder</strong> fashion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>CCG-style combat</strong> with strategic depth and thrilling turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>stylish pixel art</strong> with a nostalgic yet modern vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely free to play</strong> \u2014 dive in with no strings attached</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>short but challenging runs</strong>, perfect for replayability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0<strong>You\u2019ll love Arcana if you enjoy:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games like <i>Slay the Spire</i> or <i>Hearthstone</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep strategy and improvisation in card games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding challenges with evolving choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SF fantasy settings filled with lore and rebellion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Coming Soon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>demo version of Arcana</strong> is on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning \u2014 more stories and content are coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 Add to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0to connect with the devs and stay up-to-date on our journey through Arcana!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf\u00a0<strong>Meet Arcana</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fusion of CCG and roguelike deckbuilder in a pixel-art SF fantasy world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Earth becomes uninhabitable due to global warming, humanity crash-lands on Arcana \u2014 a planet ruled by dragonkind.\u00a0In a world of racial hierarchy and oppression, humans rise again.\u00a0Battle and persuade other species, build alliances, and challenge the dragons in a fight for equality and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and customize over <strong>130 unique cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching paths and manage resources in <strong>roguelike deckbuilder</strong> fashion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience <strong>CCG-style combat</strong> with strategic depth and thrilling turns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy <strong>stylish pixel art</strong> with a nostalgic yet modern vibe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completely free to play</strong> \u2014 dive in with no strings attached</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for <strong>short but challenging runs</strong>, perfect for replayability</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2\u00a0<strong>You\u2019ll love Arcana if you enjoy:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games like <i>Slay the Spire</i> or <i>Hearthstone</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep strategy and improvisation in card games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deckbuilding challenges with evolving choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SF fantasy settings filled with lore and rebellion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccc <strong>Coming Soon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>demo version of Arcana</strong> is on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning \u2014 more stories and content are coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 Add to your <strong>Wishlist</strong>\u00a0to connect with the devs and stay up-to-date on our journey through Arcana!</p>",
